# Wood Elves, a 1/1: "When this creature enters, search your library for a Forest card, put that card onto the battlefield, then
# shuffle." A "Forest card" is any land with the subtype Forest (CR 205.3i), so a Taiga (a Mountain Forest) is one, while a Mountain, a
# Plains and a Lightning Bolt are not (the refusals). Bot1 takes the Taiga, which enters untapped, and with an Attercop on the battlefield
# its landfall makes it a 3/2 (the land entered under Bot1's control, CR 603.6a). Bot2's Forest stays in its own library.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Attercop
Wood Elves
Plains
Plains
Mountain
Plains
Taiga
Lightning Bolt
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest x20

